m for 1s, and fully charge his Desert Power.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_af48a3f5f3aaf4ea2f41f018fc51e92a.png","video":null,"cd":46.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"},{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Because Khaleed can deal a lot of AOE damage, he works well with heroes like Roger and Karina who excel at finishing off multiple low HP targets.","heroes":[{"id":39,"name":"Roger","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b40e578f13465b3ae99d0a9baac7ecc9.png"},{"id":8,"name":"Karina","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f49394186dc0e55d545da8377be83280.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Khaleed counters heroes who lack mobility like Cyclops and Xavier since they will have difficult time avoiding his combo.","heroes":[{"id":33,"name":"Cyclops","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_68da456f9c01b2f88d29ee320db181ed.png"},{"id":115,"name":"Xavier","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_df0a8dfc494f85ed9bbc4512cc1e5d3c.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Khaleed is countered by heroes who have the ability to knock him back or airborne to interrupt his 2nd Skill, such as X.Borg and Chou.","heroes":[{"id":83,"name":"X.Borg","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_efe9c7ed8d8f84f1bb0f88a3e08de5fc.png"},{"id":26,"name":"Chou","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_158209b180032c4564b8f3bde8c48888.png"}]}},"official_url":"https://play.mobilelegends.com/lore/hero/Khaleed","skins":[{"name":"Desert Scimitar","name_slug":"Desert-Scimitar","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/khaleed/Khaleed-Desert-Scimitar-20240403054051.webp","image_filename":"Khaleed-Desert-Scimitar-2